.TH SDL_GetJoystickTypeForID 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetJoystickTypeForID \- Get the type of a joystick, if available.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_joystick.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_JoystickType SDL_GetJoystickTypeForID(SDL_JoystickID instance_id);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This can be called before any joysticks are opened\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I instance_id
the joystick instance ID\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the
.BR SDL_JoystickType
of the selected joystick\[char46] If called with an invalid instance_id, this function returns
.BR SDL_JOYSTICK_TYPE_UNKNOWN \[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_GetJoystickType (3),
.BR SDL_GetJoysticks (3)
